mods/prodsovet/art/creatures/codex-*.png:
Adapted from the official Codex TUI companion spritesheet
codex-spritesheet-v4.webp (OpenAI). The personal mod maps idle/running/waiting/
jumping frames to idle/working/blocked/done and scales them into 16-frame strips.

mods/prodsovet/art/creatures/claude-*.png:
Clawd, the Claude Code welcome-screen mascot (Anthropic), reconstructed from
terminal block glyphs and animated into 16-frame strips for the personal mod.

